Two-Handed Specialization teaches warriors and deikhans to maximize the
effectiveness of two-handed weapons. Unlike other weapon specializations
that increase attack speed, this skill grants additional attacks per round
based on your proficiency level.

Two-handed weapons already deal significantly more damage than their
one-handed counterparts, but sacrifice the ability to use a shield or
dual wield. Masters of two-handed combat learn to compensate through
devastating attack combinations that can overwhelm opponents.

This skill applies to all weapons requiring both hands to wield, including
greatswords, battleaxes, mauls, polearms, and staves.

